          "characterId": "willa",
          "text": "\"Oh no,\" quacked Willa. \"My ducklings are hiding again!\""
        },
        {
          "characterId": "pip",
          "text": "\"Don't worry,\" said Pip, taking her wing. \"We'll find every single one.\""
